# test_model (-t): several lines; ctrl+j a new line (headless has no alt+enter), then typed and
# pasted; `enter`: the text, its lines parted by \n. A paste of several
# lines: the unit tests (twin.js).
--size 50x14 --for 2.5s --at 1.9s --styles
--focus 1.5s:ask --key 1.6s:ctrl+j --key 1.7s:c --paste 1.8s:d
--key 2s:enter
-t Why? --default ab
